OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786717110
OL,3,CM54 closed in Shropshire after lorry
OL,4,Ccarrying 70 tonnes of hay caught fire
OL,6,FThe M54 in Shropshire has been closed
OL,7,Fafter a lorry transporting around 70
OL,8,Ftonnes of hay caught fire.
OL,10,FThe motorway's westbound carriageway
OL,11,Fwas shut between Junction 3 for
OL,12,FBrighton and Junction 4 for Shifnall
OL,13,Fwhen the blaze erupted on Tuesday
OL,14,Fevening.
OL,16,FSix fire engines were deployed to
OL,17,Ftackle the blaze just before 6.30pm
OL,18,Flast night. Crews managed to
OL,19,Fextinguish the fire.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/3
