OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786717110
OL,3,CM54 closed in Shropshire after lorry
OL,4,Ccarrying 70 tonnes of hay caught fire
OL,6,FRecovery and clean up crews were at
OL,7,Fthe scene this morning, National
OL,8,FHighways said.
OL,10,FThe M54 Westbound remains closed on
OL,11,FWednesday morning with road diversions
OL,12,Fin place.
OL,14,FThere were long delays on the
OL,15,Fcarriageway with queuing traffic,
OL,16,Faccording to travel monitoring system
OL,17,FInrix.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/3
