OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786717110
OL,3,CM54 closed in Shropshire after lorry
OL,4,Ccarrying 70 tonnes of hay caught fire
OL,6,FShropshire Fire and Rescue Service has
OL,7,Fadvised people to stay away from the
OL,8,Farea and use an alternative travel
OL,9,Froute where possible.
OL,11,FThey said in a statement on Twitter:
OL,12,F"The M54 westbound remains closed
OL,13,Fbetween Junction 3 and Junction 4
OL,14,Fwhile emergency services continue to
OL,15,Fdeal with the incident.
OL,17,F"The public are advised to stay away
OL,18,Ffrom the area and use an alternative
OL,19,Froute where possible."
